{"duration_api_ms":3595,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f39a5493-aa9e-407d-aab3-a18a003cb125","total_cost_usd":0.0008009,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1065,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":838,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":467},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1065,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":838,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1065,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1065},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1609,"outputTokens":854,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":1065,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0008009,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":467,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":1065,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Definitions**\n- **Tracking error:** annualized standard deviation of daily (fund return − benchmark return) over the agreed one-year window (daily returns × √252).\n- **Tracking difference:** cumulative fund return minus cumulative benchmark return over the same period. It captures persistent drag such as fees and is reported separately.\n\n**Causes to investigate when tracking error exceeds the mandate's range**\n\n**Portfolio:** sampling or optimization versus full replication, and resulting active weights; cash drag and cash buffer levels; timing of index reconstitutions, rebalances, and corporate actions; weight drift, caps, and liquidity-constrained holdings.\n\n**Pricing:** fair-value adjustments and closing-price timing versus benchmark pricing; non-synchronous or stale prices; FX rate sources and fixing times; dividend accrual and withholding assumptions.\n\n**Operating:** execution slippage, commissions, and trade timing; creation/redemption flows and in-kind handling; securities lending income and collateral management; settlement failures and custody issues; benchmark data errors or delayed index updates.","ttft_ms":2025,"type":"result","duration_ms":3052,"uuid":"21e8ecc7-d603-4f9f-b785-a3c466d5cb26","ttft_stream_ms":430,"time_to_request_ms":59,"first_content_frame_ms":430,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
